| You write | Registry | Namespace / repository | Tag | |---|---|---|---| | redis | docker.io | library/redis | latest | | redis:8-alpine | docker.io | library/redis | 8-alpine | | bitnami/redis:8 | docker.io | bitnami/redis | 8 | | ghcr.io/cafe-team/cafe-api:1.4.2 | ghcr.io | cafe-team/cafe-api | 1.4.2 | | localhost:5000/cafe-team/cafe-api:1 | localhost:5000 | cafe-team/cafe-api | 1 | The first part counts as a registry only when it contains a .

