99
00:07:35,033 --> 00:07:37,758
Why would I need private registries?

100
00:07:38,300 --> 00:07:41,475
Company images belong in a private registry:

101
00:07:41,475 --> 00:07:45,733
only people and machines with credentials may push or pull.

102
00:07:45,733 --> 00:07:50,496
It can be a managed service (Amazon ECR, Azure Container Registry,

103
00:07:50,496 --> 00:07:53,454
Google Artifact Registry, GitHub, GitLab,

104
00:07:53,454 --> 00:07:59,877
Harbor, Nexus …) or the registry image you already know, with authentication switched on.

105
00:07:59,877 --> 00:08:03,485
Whatever the product, the client side is the same:

106
00:08:03,485 --> 00:08:09,474
docker login REGISTRY, then push and pull with names that start with that registry.

