135
00:10:26,995 --> 00:10:29,839
Access follows GitHub's permissions.

136
00:10:29,839 --> 00:10:42,003
From your computer you log in with a personal access token that has the write:packages scope; in GitHub Actions the job's built-in GITHUB_TOKEN is enough,

137
00:10:42,003 --> 00:10:44,926
once the workflow grants it packages:

138
00:10:44,926 --> 00:10:45,399
